  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>The KOALA GREEN 495 is a self-contained refrigerated insulated container, designed for the safe transport of perishable goods under controlled temperatures. Thanks to its integrated rechargeable battery, it ensures autonomous operation. Internal capacity: 495 liters, ideal for transporting fresh and frozen products. ATP certified, in accordance with international standards for the transport of perishable goods. [&hellip;]</p>\n",
